 "history": "Atomico was founded in London in 2006 by Skype co-founder Niklas Zennstr\u00f6m. Its early bets included Rovio, Supercell, Klarna and Truecaller, and it later backed Stripe, Hinge Health and DeepL, investing mostly from Series A onward. In 2024 it closed $1.24 billion across two funds, Atomico Venture VI and Atomico Growth VI.",
